        "cnm_p173"
      ],
      "explanation": "First evaluate the sums in the numerators and denominators: \\(2+4+6=12\\) and \\(1+3+5=9\\). The expression becomes\n\\[\n\\frac{12}{9}-\\frac{9}{12}\n=\\frac43-\\frac34\n=\\frac{16}{12}-\\frac9{12}\n=\\boxed{\\frac7{12}}.\n\\]\nThe answer is choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\).",
      "id": "evaluate-sums-and-subtract",
